                </div>
                <div class="flex" style="align-items: center; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: nowrap;">
                    <p>And more contributions, view all details on Codeberg or GitHub</p>
                    <div class="flex">
                        <a href="https://codeberg.org/ehanahamed"
                            class="button faint"
                        ><CodebergIcon></CodebergIcon> Codeberg</a>
                        <a
                            href="https://github.com/ehanahamed"
                            class="button faint"
                        ><GitHubIcon></GitHubIcon> GitHub</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
